WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.390
- We taped an interview with
Tyra a few days ago though,

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:04.870
and she had this to say about you.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.690
- Derek Hough is a new judge

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.340
this season on "Dancing With The Stars"

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.750
and so, I'm kinda tempted to ask him

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.190
to choreograph 16 counts for
me to see if I can do it.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.150
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.950
- I haven't asked him yet,
but I'm asking you now Derek,

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.627
can you choreograph that for me?

00:00:20.627 --> 00:00:21.460
(audience cheers)

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.310
- Oh boy.

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:23.360
- [Kelly] I'm just saying.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:24.193
- You know--
- I told her

00:00:24.193 --> 00:00:25.480
you should dance with her.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.840
Do some kind of, I don't know--

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:27.673
- [Derek] We'll do it.

00:00:27.673 --> 00:00:28.506
- TikTok moment, I dunno.

00:00:28.506 --> 00:00:29.410
- I'm always down with it.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:32.260
Here's the thing, I
don't need to teach Tyra

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.070
how to dance something, 'cause
she's already got it down,

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.060
she's got the walk, she's got the moves.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.570
It's more about, whenever
people make mistakes

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.575
on the show, it's not
about how well you dance,

00:00:40.575 --> 00:00:43.210
it's about how well you
cover up the mistakes, right?

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:46.670
So if she does her catwalk,
by the way, in my socks,

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:47.503
by the way.

00:00:47.503 --> 00:00:48.336
- I love it!

00:00:48.336 --> 00:00:50.168
And point those toes, point them!

00:00:50.168 --> 00:00:51.001
- Yes, yes.

00:00:51.001 --> 00:00:51.834
(both laugh)

00:00:51.834 --> 00:00:53.223
I'm glad I wore socks today.

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:56.920
No, but you know, she's
walking, and if you trip

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.150
or something like that,
you just gotta like,

00:00:58.150 --> 00:00:59.710
she does her little thing, she trips,

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:00.710
you gotta like--

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:01.899
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:01.899 --> 00:01:02.732
- You've gotta make a move out of it.

00:01:02.732 --> 00:01:03.719
- I'm not cool.

00:01:03.719 --> 00:01:04.570
- But she already knows
that, she already knows that,

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:05.403
she's got it, yeah.

00:01:05.403 --> 00:01:07.650
- That was so Patrick
Swayze, I just got lost

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:08.770
in "Dirty Dancing" again.

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:10.220
I'm gonna watch that tonight.

